  "question": {
    "text": "One mole of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> (g) at 300 K is kept in a closed container under one atmosphere. It is heated to 600 K when 20% by mass of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> (g) decomposes to <math><mtext>N</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> (g). The resultant pressure (in atm) is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2.4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><munder><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow></munder></mrow></munder><mo>↔</mo><munder><mrow><mtext>2N</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.4</mn></mrow></munder></mrow></munder></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>0.8</mn></math><br /><br />Number of moles at 300 K = 1<br /><br />No. of moles at 600 K = 0.8 + 0.4 = 1.2<br /><br />V is constant<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>600</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
